Subject: [PATCH 1/5] mt7621: QEMU-side changes for the MT7621 machine

Working-tree additions that used to live only in qemu-mt7621.patch:
instruction-cache shadow, GIC/gictimer adjustments, CP0 Def/config
tweaks for the 1004Kc model.  Committed on a local branch so revisions
can be switched with git checkout instead of applying patches.
